== Problem 9 ==
In the figure, <imath>\angle EAB</imath> and <imath>\angle ABC</imath> are right angles. <imath>AB=4, BC=6, AE=8</imath>, and <imath>AC</imath> and <imath>BE</imath> intersect at <imath>D</imath>. What is the difference between the areas of <imath>\triangle ADE</imath> and <imath>\triangle BDC</imath>?

<asy> unitsize(4mm);
